# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# package-lock.json is deliberately tracked: a fresh `npm install` of the
# unpinned ^21.2.0 tree crashes inside npm ("Cannot read properties of null
# (reading 'edgesOut')", #loadPeerSet) since @angular/ssr 22.2.3 was published
# on 2026-10-15. The lock pins the tree resolved on 2026-10-12.
!package-lock.json
